>I just installed NH 3.0 and am enjoying it. I have a problem though with
>Genocide scrolls and Polymorph with Polymorph control, every time I give
>the initial of a monster (I tried almost everything) I get the message
>"Never heard of such monster".

You must have played versions of NetHack < 3.0.  Back then, a scroll of
genocide would always genocide a class of monster. 'D' would genocide all
colors of dragons.
Now, in 3.0 an uncursed scroll of genocide will only off one kind of monster.
You have to type out the entire name, eg., "black dragon" and then only
the black dragons will be genocided.  A blessed scroll of genocide will
still let you genocide all characters represented by a particular letter.
Can't wait until you discover cursed scrolls of genocide. :)

